{"agent":"bgr","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg: bug fixed --landed <test-only-commit> crashes with InvalidValue worktree.base_ref=--local when the landing commit's committed .ddflow/config.toml carries base_ref=--local. regression_collect.tree_provides calls run_command_gate(probe, root) without cfg, so runner reloads Config.load(root) from the scratch tree (B20cfd41344's fix was applied to mutation.py:331 but missed this probe path, and regression.py:67 has the same hole).\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg"],"globs":["ddflow/services/gates/regression_collect.py","ddflow/services/gates/regression_testfix.py","ddflow/api/knowledge/regression.py","tests/test_regression_testfix.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs-2","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix","no-deps"],"title":"Fix bug B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg: --landed of a test-only fix crashes: regression_collect reloads the scratch..."},"id":"e228c17b411cd838c61acb336","kind":"task.added","lamport":161050,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-regression-collect-reloads-cfg","ts":"2026-11-09T10:17:19.244027Z"}
